t'] ?? 3600) ?>"></label><label>Cache lifetime<input name="cache_ttl_seconds" type="number" min="60" max="604800" value="<?= (int) ($cfg['cache_ttl_seconds'] ?? 86400) ?>"></label><label>Maximum cache (GB)<input name="cache_max_gb" type="number" min="1" max="1024" value="<?= max(1, (int) round(((int) ($cfg['cache_max_bytes'] ?? 53687091200)) / 1073741824)) ?>"></label></div><div class="storage-security-note"><strong>SSH host key is mandatory.</strong><span>The CMS rejects the connection before authentication when the server fingerprint differs. Host, port, and remote root are locked after assets reference this profile.</span></div></div></div><footer class="cms-modal-footer"><span>Settings are saved only after upload, size, rename, read, and delete probes succeed.</span><div><button class="btn ghost" type="button" data-cms-modal-close>Cancel</button><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Test & Save</button></div></footer></form></dialog><?php endif ?>
